{
  "requirement": "`habeas author-evidence <full-name> [--config <name>] [--stdout]` MUST assess one\nexisting requirement or named example in the current project. It MUST report the\nselected subject, backend, model, evidence destination, and usage-record path on\ncompletion. The evidence destination MUST identify the evidence-file path by\ndefault or stdout when `--stdout` is selected. In stdout mode, the completion\nreport and diagnostics MUST go to stderr.",
  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "The author-evidence CLI assesses one named subject with optional configuration selection and stdout output. The library defaults to file output, while --stdout selects pure JSON and moves the subject/backend/model/judgment, explicit stdout destination, and usage path to stderr. CLI tests exercise default file output and all judgment kinds in stdout mode, including existing and absent evidence directories.",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "file": "md/reference.md",
      "line_start": 82,
      "line_end": 82,
      "text": [
        "{cite}`requirements.authoring.invocation` {cite}`requirements.authoring.provider`"
      ]
